.tmp_server.*

# Impeccable design skill + local Claude Code settings.
# The skill is a dev tool (148 files, ~3.3 MB) reinstallable with `npx impeccable install`,
# and settings.local.json is machine-local by convention. DESIGN.md and PRODUCT.md — the
# outputs that matter to the project — ARE committed. Drop this rule if you want the design
# detector hook to travel with the repo for every contributor.
.claude/
